        <dc:creator><![CDATA[admin]]></dc:creator>
        <guid isPermaLink="false">http://localhost/?page_id=103</guid>
        <description></description>
        <content:encoded><![CDATA[I am a Communication Designer with an M.Phil. in Art & Design and over 10 years of experience in graphic design, photography, video editing, and public relations. My work blends creativity with strategic communication to build strong visual identities and meaningful brand experiences.

Having worked across educational institutions and corporate sectors, I bring a multidisciplinary approach to every project — from concept development to final execution. I am passionate about visual storytelling, detail-oriented design, and continuous learning. I strive to create impactful, purposeful designs that communicate clearly, inspire audiences, and add real value to brands and organizations.]]></content:encoded>
